Apply the exact gate to ReuseInvestigation: Each investigation resolves a named uncertainty and uses qualified professionals where required. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
